@startuml lunari-matching-path
' Story picture only. Do not pass this file to ArchUnit:
' gateway, deck-read, profiles, swipes-go live in different JARs.

title Lunari matching path
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Browser
[Gateway] as gw
[Deck Read] as dr
[Deck] as deck
[Profiles] as profiles
[Swipes Go] as swipes
[Consumer] as consumer
[Match] as match

Browser --> gw : JWT
gw --> dr : GET /api/v2/deck
gw --> swipes : POST /api/v1/swipes
dr --> deck : ensure on miss
dr --> profiles : hydrate cards (mTLS)
swipes --> consumer : swipe-created
profiles --> deck : profile.* outbox
consumer --> match : match.created outbox

note bottom of dr
  Read model. Must not own Deck ranking
  or Deck Redis write keys.
end note

note bottom of profiles
  Profile row and outbox row
  in one transaction.
end note

note bottom of gw
  User JWT stops here.
  Internal fanout is mTLS.
end note

@enduml
